---
const { ButtonLink } = Astro.props;
---
<section class="bg-base-200 border-t border-base-300">
  <div class="max-w-screen-xl px-4 py-8 mx-auto text-center lg:py-20 lg:px-6">
    <figure class="max-w-screen-md mx-auto">
      <svg class="h-8 md:h-12 mx-auto mb-3 text-primary" viewBox="0 0 24 27" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <path d="M14.017 18L14.017 10.609C14.017 4.905 17.748 1.039 23 0L23.995 2.151C21.563 3.068 20 5.789 20 8H24V18H14.017ZM0 18V10.609C0 4.905 3.748 1.038 9 0L9.996 2.151C7.563 3.068 6 5.789 6 8H9.983L9.983 18L0 18Z" fill="currentColor"></path>
      </svg>
      <blockquote>
        <p class="text-md lg:text-lg font-medium">"In {new Date().getFullYear()} it makes absolutely NO sense to be developing sites with Wordpress. Modern sites are faster, cheaper and are less headache to maintain. Why pay $30-50/mo or more for hosting when you can have a faster site for almost nothing"</p>
      </blockquote>
      <figcaption class="flex items-center justify-center mt-6 space-x-3">
        <img
          class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full"
          src="https://gravatar.com/userimage/98702177/66460bceea4ae0fec9c1de70910bd9af.jpeg?size=64"
          alt="Mike A., Agency Owner"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <div class="flex items-center divide-x-2 divide-primary">
          <div class="pr-3 font-medium">Mike A.</div>
          <div class="pl-3 text-sm font-light">Web Developer, 30+ years experience</div>
        </div>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>

    <div class="mt-6">
      <ButtonLink href="/contact" variant="primary" size="lg">Schedule Free Assessment</ButtonLink>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm">Limited to 3 assessments per week</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>